#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:2
msgid "Configuration file overview"
msgstr "配置文件概览"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"As part of the initial set up of a Read the Docs project, you need to create"
" a **configuration file** called ``.readthedocs.yaml``. The configuration "
"file tells Read the Docs what specific settings to use for your project."
msgstr ""
"作为 Read the Docs 项目初始设置的一部分，你需要创建一个名为 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` 的**配置文件**。配置文件告诉"
" Read the Docs 为你的项目使用哪些特定设置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:8
msgid "This tutorial covers:"
msgstr "本教程涵盖："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:15
msgid "Where to put your configuration file"
msgstr "配置文件放置位置"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:17
msgid ""
"The ``.readthedocs.yaml`` file should be placed in the top-most directory of"
" your project's repository. When you have changed the configuration file, "
"you need to commit and push the changes to your Git repository. Read the "
"Docs will then automatically find and use the configuration to build your "
"project."
msgstr ""
"``.readthedocs.yaml`` 文件应放在项目仓库的最顶层目录。修改配置文件后，你需要提交并推送变更到 Git 仓库。Read the "
"Docs 随后会自动找到并使用该配置来构建你的项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:24
msgid ""
"The Read the Docs configuration file is a `YAML`_ file. YAML is a human-"
"friendly data serialization language for all programming languages. To learn"
" more about the structure of these files, see the `YAML language overview`_."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 配置文件是 `YAML`_ 文件。YAML 是一种对人类友好的数据序列化语言，适用于所有编程语言。了解更多文件结构，请参阅 "
"`YAML language overview`_。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:34
msgid "Getting started with a template"
msgstr "使用模板快速开始"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:36
msgid ""
"Here are some configuration file examples to help you get started. Pick an "
"example based on the tool that your project is using, copy its contents to "
"``.readthedocs.yaml``, and add the file to your Git repository."
msgstr ""
"以下是一些配置文件示例，帮助你快速开始。根据你的项目使用的工具选择一个示例，将其内容复制到 "
"``.readthedocs.yaml``，并将文件添加到你的 Git 仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:43
msgid "Sphinx"
msgstr "Sphinx"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:45
msgid ""
"If your project uses Sphinx, we offer a special builder optimized for Sphinx"
" projects."
msgstr "如果你的项目使用 Sphinx，我们提供一个针对 Sphinx 项目优化的特殊构建器。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:48
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:59
msgid ".readthedocs.yaml"
msgstr ".readthedocs.yaml"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:54
msgid "MkDocs"
msgstr "MkDocs"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:56
msgid ""
"If your project uses MkDocs, we offer a special builder optimized for MkDocs"
" projects."
msgstr "如果你的项目使用 MkDocs，我们提供一个针对 MkDocs 项目优化的特殊构建器。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:64
msgid ""
"You can find more information about these tools in our "
":doc:`/intro/doctools`."
msgstr "你可以在 :doc:`/intro/doctools` 中找到关于这些工具的更多信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:67
msgid "Editing the template"
msgstr "编辑模板"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:69
msgid ""
"Now that you have a ``.readthedocs.yaml`` file added to your Git repository,"
" you should see Read the Docs trying to build your project with the "
"configuration file. The configuration file probably needs some adjustments "
"to accommodate exactly your project setup."
msgstr ""
"现在你已经将 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` 文件添加到 Git 仓库，应该能看到 Read the Docs "
"尝试使用该配置文件构建你的项目。配置文件可能需要一些调整，以完全适配你的项目设置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:75
msgid ""
"If you added the configuration file in a separate branch, you may have to "
"activate a :doc:`version </versions>` for that branch."
msgstr "如果你在单独的分支中添加了配置文件，可能需要为该分支激活一个 :doc:`版本 </versions>`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:78
msgid ""
"If you have added the file in a pull request, make sure :doc:`pull request "
"builds </guides/pull-requests>` are enabled."
msgstr ""
"如果你在 Pull Request 中添加了该文件，请确保已启用 :doc:`Pull Request 构建 </guides/pull-"
"requests>`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:82
msgid "Skip: file header and comments"
msgstr "跳过：文件头与注释"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:84
msgid "There are some parts of the templates that you can leave in place:"
msgstr "模板中有些部分你可以保留原样："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:86
msgid "``version`` key"
msgstr "``version`` 键"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:87
msgid ""
"The version key tells the system how to read the rest of the configuration "
"file. The current and only supported version is **version 2**."
msgstr "version 键告诉系统如何读取配置文件的其余部分。当前唯一支持的版本是 **version 2**。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:90
msgid "Comments"
msgstr "注释"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:91
msgid ""
"We added comments that explain the configuration options and optional "
"features. These lines begin with a ``#``."
msgstr "我们添加了注释来解释配置选项和可选功能。这些行以 ``#`` 开头。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:94
msgid "Commented out features"
msgstr "被注释掉的功能"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:95
msgid ""
"We use the ``#`` in front of some popular configuration options. They are "
"there as examples, which you can choose to enable, delete or save for later."
msgstr "我们在一些流行的配置选项前使用了 ``#``。它们作为示例存在，你可以选择启用、删除或保留以备后用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:100
msgid "Adjust: ``build.os``"
msgstr "调整：``build.os``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:102
msgid ""
"In our examples, we are using Read the Docs' custom image based on the "
"latest Ubuntu release. Package versions in these images will not change "
"drastically, though will receive periodic security updates."
msgstr "在示例中，我们使用基于最新 Ubuntu 版本的 Read the Docs 自定义镜像。这些镜像中的包版本不会剧烈变化，但会定期接收安全更新。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:107
msgid ""
"You should pay attention to this field if your project needs to build on an "
"older version of Ubuntu, or in the future when you need features from a "
"newer Ubuntu."
msgstr "如果你的项目需要在旧版 Ubuntu 上构建，或未来需要新版 Ubuntu 的功能，请留意此字段。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:112
msgid ":ref:`config-file/v2:build.os`"
msgstr ":ref:`config-file/v2:build.os`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:113
msgid "Configuration file reference with all values possible for ``build.os``."
msgstr "包含 ``build.os`` 所有可能值的配置文件参考。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:116
msgid "Adjust: Python configuration"
msgstr "调整：Python 配置"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:118
msgid ""
"If you are using Python in your builds, you should define the Python version"
" in ``build.tools.python``."
msgstr "如果你在构建中使用 Python，应在 ``build.tools.python`` 中定义 Python 版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:121
msgid ""
"The ``python`` key contains a list of sub-keys, specifying the requirements "
"to install."
msgstr "``python`` 键包含一组子键，指定要安装的依赖。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:124
msgid ""
"Use ``python.install.path`` to install the project itself as a Python "
"package using pip"
msgstr "使用 ``python.install.path`` 通过 pip 将项目本身作为 Python 包安装"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:125
msgid ""
"Use ``python.install.requirements`` to install packages from a requirements "
"file"
msgstr "使用 ``python.install.requirements`` 从 requirements 文件安装包"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:126
msgid ""
"Use ``python.install.method: uv`` to install packages with ``uv sync`` or "
"``uv pip``"
msgstr "使用 ``python.install.method: uv`` 通过 ``uv sync`` 或 ``uv pip`` 安装包"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:127
msgid "Use ``build.jobs`` for Poetry, PDM, or advanced custom install workflows"
msgstr "使用 ``build.jobs`` 实现 Poetry、PDM 或高级自定义安装工作流"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:131
msgid ":ref:`config-file/v2:build.tools.python`"
msgstr ":ref:`config-file/v2:build.tools.python`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:132
msgid ""
"Configuration file reference with all Python versions available for "
"``build.tools.python``."
msgstr "包含 ``build.tools.python`` 所有可用 Python 版本的配置文件参考。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:134
msgid ":ref:`config-file/v2:python`"
msgstr ":ref:`config-file/v2:python`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:135
msgid ""
"Configuration file reference for configuring the Python environment "
"activated by ``build.tools.python``."
msgstr "配置由 ``build.tools.python`` 激活的 Python 环境的配置文件参考。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:138
msgid "Adjust: Sphinx and MkDocs version"
msgstr "调整：Sphinx 和 MkDocs 版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:140
msgid ""
"If you are using either the ``sphinx`` or ``mkdocs`` builder, then Sphinx or"
" MkDocs will be installed automatically in its latest version."
msgstr "如果你使用 ``sphinx`` 或 ``mkdocs`` 构建器，Sphinx 或 MkDocs 将自动以最新版本安装。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:143
msgid ""
"But we recommend that you specify the version that your documentation "
"project uses. The ``requirements`` key is a file path that points to a text "
"(``.txt``) file that lists the Python packages you want Read the Docs to "
"install."
msgstr ""
"但我们建议你指定文档项目所用的版本。``requirements`` 键是一个文件路径，指向一个文本（``.txt``）文件，列出你希望 Read "
"the Docs 安装的 Python 包。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:149
msgid ""
":ref:`guides/reproducible-builds:Use a requirements file for Python "
"dependencies`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`guides/reproducible-builds:Use a requirements file for Python "
"dependencies`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:150
msgid ""
"This guide explains how to specify Python requirements, such as the version "
"of Sphinx or MkDocs."
msgstr "本指南解释如何指定 Python 依赖，例如 Sphinx 或 MkDocs 的版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:153
msgid ":ref:`config-file/v2:sphinx`"
msgstr ":ref:`config-file/v2:sphinx`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:154
msgid "Configuration file reference for configuring the Sphinx builder."
msgstr "配置 Sphinx 构建器的配置文件参考。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:156
msgid ":ref:`config-file/v2:mkdocs`"
msgstr ":ref:`config-file/v2:mkdocs`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:157
msgid "Configuration file reference for configuring the MkDocs builder."
msgstr "配置 MkDocs 构建器的配置文件参考。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:160
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "后续步骤"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:162
msgid "There are more configuration options that the ones mentioned in this guide."
msgstr "除了本指南提到的选项，还有更多配置选项可用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:164
msgid ""
"After you add a configuration file your Git repository, and you can see that"
" Read the Docs is building your documentation using the file, you should "
"have a look at the complete configuration file reference for options that "
"might apply to your project."
msgstr "将配置文件添加到 Git 仓库并看到 Read the Docs 正在使用该文件构建文档后，你应该查看完整的配置文件参考，了解可能适用于你项目的选项。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:170
msgid ":doc:`/config-file/v2`."
msgstr ":doc:`/config-file/v2`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:171
msgid ""
"The complete list of all possible ``.readthedocs.yaml`` settings, including "
"the optional settings not covered in on this page."
msgstr "所有可能的 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` 设置的完整列表，包括本页未涵盖的可选设置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:174
msgid ":doc:`/build-customization`"
msgstr ":doc:`/build-customization`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/index.rst:175
msgid ""
"Are familiar with running a command line? Perhaps there are special commands"
" that you know you want Read the Docs to run. Read this guide and learn more"
" about how you add your own commands to ``.readthedocs.yaml``."
msgstr ""
"熟悉运行命令行？也许有些特殊命令是你明确希望 Read the Docs 运行的。阅读本指南，了解如何将你自己的命令添加到 "
"``.readthedocs.yaml``。"

